<title>POLAND: Echo sees 1996 net soaring to PLN 2.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Echo sees 1996 net soaring to PLN 2.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish publisher Echo SA sees its net profit soaring to 2.7 million zlotys from 0.4 million last year and sales jumping to 50.5 million, up from 7.3 million in 1995, the firm said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said it expected to earn 2.3 million zlotys on 37.8 million sales in the first six months of 1997.</p>
<p>It said it did not plan payouts in the next two or three years, because of a large investment programme.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
